							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Yeah, cause I can keep tabs on what 80+ of my members say to every individual on the server...</div><br />&nbsp;I was using meoww as an example .. don&#039;t try and make it seem like I&#039;m saying you should know exactly what that each person says.  Ysa&#039;s response is great, but the policy is certainly not being enforced.  You have multiple people from different guilds saying this, and the response is basically ....<br /><br />&#039;NO SS DIDNT HAPPEN&#039;<br /><br />&nbsp;I mean come on, do you actually think multiple people would bother coming here, making up posts about Convicts?  For what reason?  So what if you did recruit from other guilds, will the sky fall and the earth rip apart?<br /><br />What I would do if I heard this kind of complaint?  I would say np, I&#039;ll make sure the guild is aware of our policies.  Not basically call people liars.<br /><br />&nbsp;I guess you should be <b>flattered</b> that people are putting in the effort to make you look bad for no reason tho.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley8.gif" alt="smiley8" border="0" />
						</td>
