							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10696#msg10696"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10696#msg10696">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> September 01, 2004, 01:41:20 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							This thread is going nowhere, and needs more drama.<br /><br />Your guilds all suck, and are all going nowhere. Jump ship and apply to another guild. The Euro and Asian guilds on the Maelin Starpyre server need you. They&#039;re all going places.
						</td>
