	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10698"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=271" title="View the profile of Llew">Llew</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 11<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/matrix.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Knight General of Conviction<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=271"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10698#msg10698"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10698#msg10698">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #39 on:</b> September 01, 2004, 03:30:43 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Retrieval,<br /><br />For being a guild officer I kinda expect you to read the thread a little closer and without the obvious bias you seem to have <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />.&nbsp; Conviction&#039;s response has been &quot;It&#039;s not our policy, send us the names and we&#039;ll take care of it&quot;.&nbsp; The inflammatory and vague nature of the first post in the thread and every accusatory one thereafter are the reasons why <i>others</i> are discrediting them being genuine claims.&nbsp; This is all ignoring the obvious fact that this is a pretty silly thing to come here and rant about anyway.&nbsp; &quot;OH NOS, ONE OF YOUR GUILD&#039;S APPLICANTS JOKINGLY TOLD ME I SHOULD DISBAND AND APPLY.&nbsp; YOUR GUILD IS THE DEBIL&quot;.<br /><br />To clarify again.&nbsp; It&#039;s not Conviction&#039;s policy to recruit from other guilds, send an officer the name of anyone who is and it will gladly be taken care of.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
