								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10703#msg10703"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10703#msg10703">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #40 on:</b> September 01, 2004, 05:57:30 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							He means people like me&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/saint.gif" alt="Saint" border="0" /><br /><br />I have no ties to Conviction, I just figured the original poster was drumming up a story and I wanted to see what would ensue.
						</td>
					</tr>
